  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional decision to Yemen humanitarian appeal 2011.                 As the situation in Yemen has escalated during 2011 it has been      justified that additional support is provided among others to IDP and  refugees. In the additional decision support to ERF/OCHA and Save    the Children is also included.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Till&#xe4;ggsbeslut till Jemen humanit&#xe4;r appell 2011.                       D&#xe5; situationen i Jemen eskalterat under 2011 &#xe4;r det befogad att ge   ytterligare st&#xf6;d till bl.a. internflyktingar och flyktingar.           I till&#xe4;ggsbeslutet ing&#xe5;r &#xe4;ven st&#xf6;d till ERF/OCHA och R&#xe4;dda Barnen.</narrative>
  </description>
